# iCloud sync conflict copies. This project lives in ~/Documents, which syncs,
# and a conflict leaves a "<name> 2.ts" beside the original. 35 of them were
# committed once, including stale copies of the auth and session code.
* [0-9].*

# Tile pyramids ARE committed: the portal serves the map from them, so they have
# to reach Vercel. They stay small because empty tiles are never written, about
# 1 MB for the Kotba survey. Once a site passes the 50 MB trigger in context.md
# 8h, that site moves to object storage and gets ignored here instead.
